      <h2 class="sec-title" id="pillars-h">Four pillars, <em>one outcome</em>.</h2>
      <p class="sec-lead">Self sufficiency is not one problem. It is four. Solve three and a woman is still stuck.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-4">
      <article class="card card-light reveal">
        <span class="card-num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <div class="card-ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B5822F" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 10.5 12 3l9 7.5"/><path d="M5 9.8V20h14V9.8"/><path d="M9.5 20v-5.5h5V20"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Transitional Housing</h3>
        <p>Safe, sober housing with case management, life skills coaching, and support groups, plus direct help finding work and permanent housing.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card card-light reveal d1">
        <span class="card-num" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <div class="card-ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B5822F" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 16V9.5l1.8-4A2 2 0 0 1 7.6 4h8.8a2 2 0 0 1 1.8 1.5L20 9.5V16"/><path d="M3 16h18"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="18" r="1.6"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="18" r="1.6"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Transportation</h3>
        <p>Bus passes, ride share vouchers, gas cards, and volunteer drivers, so work, court, treatment, and childcare stay reachable.</p>
      </article>

